hu-035-peixiu-peiwei","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015","quote":"初，頠兄子憬為白衣，頠論述世勳，賜爵高陽亭侯。楊駿將誅也，駿党左軍將軍劉豫陳兵在門，遇頠，問太傅所在。頠紿之曰：「向於西掖門遇公乘素車，從二人西出矣。」豫曰：「吾何之？」頠曰：「宜至廷尉。」豫從頠言，遂委而去。尋而詔頠代豫領左軍將軍，屯萬春門。及駿誅，以功當封武昌侯，頠請以封憬，帝竟封頠次子該。頠苦陳憬本承嫡，宜襲钜鹿，先帝恩旨，辭不獲命。武昌之封，己之所蒙，特請以封憬。該時尚主，故帝不聽。累遷侍中。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015:m0146","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015:m0143"}],"interpretation_note":"以本源明父／子稱與具名傳主承接配置父系；字母只作結構位置，不作排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）"}},{"id":"lzb_bsi_bu7","label":"公主（該妻，未名）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"主","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015:m0190"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","source_id":"s-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei-ws2506399","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015","mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015:m0190","quote":"主"}],"review":"source_local_candidate","identity_note":"尚主明婚姻；不猜繁昌、不推某帝為父，也不先填司馬姓。 僅按固定裴秀／裴頠完整單元登記；未證同人者不作永久必異斷言。"}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei-ws2506399","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015:m0190"],"paragraph_ids":["c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015:m0190","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015:m0190"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei-ws2506399"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"